      401.93,
      401.86,
      413.27
    ],
    "text": "(1)by the repeal of paragraph (a) of that section; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      183.57,
      425.33,
      401.85,
      448.43
    ],
    "text": "(2)by the renumbering of paragraphs (b), (c), (d) and(e) of that section as paragraphs (a), (b), (c) and (d).",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      460.25,
      401.9,
      483.47
    ],
